"Screenshot failed. On GNOME / Ubuntu, install xdg-desktop-portal-gnome (e.g. "
"sudo apt install xdg-desktop-portal-gnome) and log out and back in."
msgstr ""
"Det gick inte att ta skärmbild. Installera xdg-desktop-portal-gnome i GNOME "
