msgid ""
"Screenshot failed. On {desktop}, install xdg-desktop-portal-gnome (or xdg-"
"desktop-portal-kde) and log out and back in. On modern Ubuntu xdg-desktop-"
"portal-gtk no longer provides the Screenshot interface."
